  "body": "Our Spanish-based owner has decided it is time to relinquish her European-inspired haven on Takapuna's coveted Golden Mile. Privately positioned well back from the road behind an automatic gate, this substantial 337sqm solid masonry residence enjoys a wonderfully peaceful and private setting, offering a lifestyle of space, comfort and understated sophistication.\r\n\r\nA timeless European aesthetic is woven throughout, with classic white shutters, wrought-iron balustrades, bedroom ceiling fans and impressive high ceilings. Light-filled interiors, generous proportions and an abundance of double-glazed windows create a relaxed yet sophisticated coastal ambience, with a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers exceptional flexibility for guests, teenagers or extended family, featuring its own spacious lounge with gas fireplace, bedroom and bathroom. The internal garage accommodates up to three vehicles, with abundant additional storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the heart of the home is where family and friends naturally come together. A generous lounge, warmed by a gas fireplace, opens on one side to a Juliet balcony and on the other to a pergola-covered terrace. Enjoying beautiful sunshine well into the evening during summer, this inviting outdoor setting is perfect for relaxed entertaining and long summer evenings. Expansive doors surrounding the dining area open wide to invite fresh air and enhance the sense of space. The well-appointed chef's kitchen is equally impressive, featuring a substantial island bench and quality Miele appliances. Three double bedrooms are also positioned on this level, complemented by a guest powder room and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe entire top floor is devoted to an impressive master retreat, offering exceptional space, comfort and privacy. The generous bedroom provides ample room for a nursery or private sitting area, while the beautifully appointed tiled ensuite features a spa bath, twin vanities and double shower. A dedicated dressing room completes the suite, with illuminated attic storage providing a practical solution for luggage and seasonal belongings.\r\n\r\nSophisticated, stylish and exceptionally spacious, this is Golden Mile living at its finest - a private European-inspired coastal sanctuary in one of Takapuna's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nAuction 17th December at 12.00pm (Unless Sold Prior) In Rooms, 128 Hurstmere Road, Takapuna\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/GMG7",
